{"parse":{"title":"角色印象卡：伊奇","pageid":3158,"revid":6710,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%8A%E5%A5%87&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%8A%E5%A5%87&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%8A%E5%A5%87&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>角色印象卡：伊奇</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E5.8D.B0.E8.B1.A1.E5.8D.A1.7C.E4.BC.8A.E5.A5.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色印象卡|伊奇\">角色印象卡|伊奇</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E4%BC%8A%E5%A5%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：角色印象卡|伊奇\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-09-21 16:10<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FFzwuDpFxN5NBYjZb2v0n9A\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FzwuDpFxN5NBYjZb2v0n9A</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>薇尔德流浪舞团的<font color=\"green\"><b>斥候</b></font>和<font color=\"green\"><b>护卫</b></font>。性格<font color=\"green\"><b>单纯善良耿直</b></font>。有着一头微乱银白色头发的他，总是令人联想到<font color=\"green\"><b>毛茸茸的小狗</b></font>，只要你报以善意，他就会给你笨拙的回报。对伊奇来说，家人和舞团就是他的<font color=\"green\"><b>全部</b></font>。<br />\n他擅长<font color=\"green\"><b>侦察和狩猎</b></font>大型动物，手中短枪据说是某个<font color=\"green\"><b>伊利亚朋友</b></font>的礼物，这也使他对伊利亚人有着相对一般薇尔德人更多的<font color=\"green\"><b>好感和信任</b></font>。<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息225.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c8/en3ngjad9wssz0z8n7decswypxe8nj6.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022112828\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1939/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.644      1 -total\n 54.96%   15.193      1 模板:面包屑\n 44.68%   12.352      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3158-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022112828 and revision id 6710. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息225.jpg"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"角色印象卡|伊奇","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"角色印象卡：伊奇","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"角色印象卡|伊奇"}],"displaytitle":"角色印象卡：伊奇","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=角色印象卡|伊奇=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间=2023-09-21 16:10\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FzwuDpFxN5NBYjZb2v0n9A\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-